    "projects": [
      {
        "source_text": "Enterprise Document AI & Compliance Automation Oct 2024 – Present\nTech: FastAPI, Python, PostgreSQL, Azure OCR, NER, Gemini LLM\n– Built a backend system to extract and validate invoice data from scanned image-based PDF documents using Azure OCR and NER.\n– Designed a matching engine to cross-reference extracted data across multiple documents and detect inconsistencies before manual review.\n– Integrated Gemini LLM to generate human-readable summaries and support compliance verification.\n– Applied similarity- and metadata-based ML logic to automatically group related multi-page invoice documents.\n– Implemented event-driven document processing using PostgreSQL NOTIFY & LISTEN, eliminating polling delays and enabling real-time workflow automation.\n– Developed FastAPI REST APIs for document upload, OCR processing, data validation, and digital invoice generation.\n– Reduced manual document review effort by 70–85% across production workloads.",
